<p>Other community resources for Project+, made by the P+ community.</p>

<h3>Frame data &amp; mechanics</h3>
<ul class="resourceList">
    <li>
        <a href="https://rukaidata.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer">rukaidata</a>
        <span class="resourceDesc">Frame data, hitboxes and hurtboxes for every character and move, generated from the game files.</span>
    </li>
    <li>
        <a href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1cp8_dGoGHP5SqbFjqqdygDX2QMW8lNNDeYRbSiLG4xE" rel="noopener noreferrer">P+ 3.2 Attributes</a>
        <span class="resourceDesc">Character attributes for P+ 3.2, with links to other P+ community docs.</span>
    </li>
    <li>
        <a href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1SAZ6-D3iARG3z8bwPBPS2PEe2pxIxx73ConGI4dYuK0" rel="noopener noreferrer">Knockback, Launch Speed, Hitstun, Hitlag &amp; Shieldstun Calculation for P+ 3.2</a>
        <span class="resourceDesc">Enter a hit's damage, BKB and KBG and the victim's character and percent to get knockback, hitstun, hitlag, shieldstun and frame advantage on shield. By Strong Bad, updated for P+ by Connor.</span>
    </li>
    <li>
        <a href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1bXKx_0QJxXFkCkElydrvm_qS4bo_ufUlDGQXfroBDG4" rel="noopener noreferrer">Moves vs ASDI Down</a>
        <span class="resourceDesc">The percent at which a move breaks crouch cancel and ASDI down on each character, from its damage, BKB, KBG and angle. Original by Mawwwk.</span>
    </li>
</ul>

<h3>Technique</h3>
<ul class="resourceList">
    <li>
        <a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ifRRGC4T3h-LU3cbpotYsWFYhppYB4oO0NXpA4Rg2ME" rel="noopener noreferrer">Comprehensive list of P+ tech cues</a>
